{"4019180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ULTRA0", "steam_appid": 4019180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >★Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ULTRA0&quot; is an easy-to-play pseudo-3D shooter that has a lot of visual novel parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In N Country, facing extinction from relentless monster attacks, young girls take up arms against the approaching threats.<br>You play as the elite warrior <strong>Shirogane</strong>, tasked with hunting down mysterious giant monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect supply items to power up your character and take down wave after wave of monstrous foes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >★Simple Controls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your character to aim at enemies, and attacks will be automatically unleashed.<br>Powerful <strong>Bombs</strong> and <strong>Skills</strong> can also be activated with a single button press!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate the oncoming monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/77b2c97468d11a6aed6770b372b7f6fe.poster.avif?t=1786531850\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/77b2c97468d11a6aed6770b372b7f6fe.webm?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/77b2c97468d11a6aed6770b372b7f6fe.mp4?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >★Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was ten years ago when a kaiju first appeared in Nation N.<br>Countless lives have been lost in the long and brutal struggle that followed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the last line of defense rests in the hands of the remaining girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them is <strong>Shirogane</strong>, a member of the elite Unit 81—one of the most dangerous active combat zones. With exceptional combat prowess, she has saved her comrades time and time again from the kaiju threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, once again, she steps onto the battlefield—<br>to face a new, unknown kaiju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/54b434298c12ecc749e5418d8d2e11f9.avif?t=1786531850\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger with items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be obtained randomly along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're lucky, the item's effect might be doubled or tripled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/2b5b43fbc8ee065143b7a129378363e9.poster.avif?t=1786531850\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/2b5b43fbc8ee065143b7a129378363e9.webm?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/2b5b43fbc8ee065143b7a129378363e9.mp4?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist changes with each chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/002d7e0bc11843eaee47136d7d5e3c12.avif?t=1786531850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras_big/002d7e0bc11843eaee47136d7d5e3c12.webp?t=1786531850 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >★Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ULTRA0&quot; is an easy-to-play pseudo-3D shooter that has a lot of visual novel parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In N Country, facing extinction from relentless monster attacks, young girls take up arms against the approaching threats.<br>You play as the elite warrior <strong>Shirogane</strong>, tasked with hunting down mysterious giant monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect supply items to power up your character and take down wave after wave of monstrous foes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >★Simple Controls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your character to aim at enemies, and attacks will be automatically unleashed.<br>Powerful <strong>Bombs</strong> and <strong>Skills</strong> can also be activated with a single button press!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate the oncoming monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/77b2c97468d11a6aed6770b372b7f6fe.poster.avif?t=1786531850\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/77b2c97468d11a6aed6770b372b7f6fe.webm?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/77b2c97468d11a6aed6770b372b7f6fe.mp4?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >★Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was ten years ago when a kaiju first appeared in Nation N.<br>Countless lives have been lost in the long and brutal struggle that followed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the last line of defense rests in the hands of the remaining girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them is <strong>Shirogane</strong>, a member of the elite Unit 81—one of the most dangerous active combat zones. With exceptional combat prowess, she has saved her comrades time and time again from the kaiju threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, once again, she steps onto the battlefield—<br>to face a new, unknown kaiju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/54b434298c12ecc749e5418d8d2e11f9.avif?t=1786531850\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger with items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be obtained randomly along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're lucky, the item's effect might be doubled or tripled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/2b5b43fbc8ee065143b7a129378363e9.poster.avif?t=1786531850\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/2b5b43fbc8ee065143b7a129378363e9.webm?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/2b5b43fbc8ee065143b7a129378363e9.mp4?t=1786531850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist changes with each chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019180/extras/002d7e0bc11843eaee47136d7d5e3c12.avif?t=1786531850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto